# Dev server

Aurin runs `npm run dev` in their own PowerShell. Leave that process alone.

If a server is needed to verify a change and one is already listening on port 3000, use it and do not stop it.

Only stop a dev server this agent started. Do not kill other processes on port 3000. Do not leave an agent-started server running when the turn ends.
